{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16121","headline":"赠索暹将军 · 王建","name":"赠索暹将军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浑身着箭瘢犹在，万槊千刀总过来。\n轮劒直冲生马队，抽旗旋踏死人堆。\n闻休鬬战心还痒，见说烟尘眼即开。\n泪滴先皇堦下土，南衙班里趁朝回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16121.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16121","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}